  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Argentina Rural Education Improvement Project - PROMER</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&apos;s Development Objective is to support national Government policy to: (i) improve the coverage, efficiency, and qualityof the Argentine education system, and (ii) to improve the governance of the Argentine education system through strengthening of thenormative, planning, information, monitoring, and evaluation capacity at the national and provincial levels.</narrative>
  </description>
